{"seq":1,"slug":"parallel-mpi","title":"并行计算与 MPI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/hpc-practice/parallel-mpi","wordCount":2653,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"并行计算与-mpi\">并行计算与 MPI</h1><p>一个三维湍流直接数值模拟可能需要追踪 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>1024</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1024^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">102</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个网格点的速度场，一个全球气候模型需要同时计算大气、海洋、海冰和陆面的耦合演化，一个分子动力学仿真需要积分数百万原子的牛顿运动方程——这些问题的计算量和内存需求远远超出单个处理器的能力。并行计算通过将工作分配到多个处理器上协同求解，使这些大规模仿真成为可能。消息传递接口（Message Passing Interface, MPI）是分布式内存并行编程的事实标准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>并行计算的基本模型分为两类：共享内存和分布式内存。共享内存模型中，所有处理器访问同一块内存，通过读写共享变量进行通信（如 OpenMP、pthread）。分布式内存模型中，每个处理器有自己的私有内存，处理器之间通过网络发送消息来交换数据（如 MPI）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[并行计算模型] --&gt; B{内存模型?}&#10;    B --&gt;|共享内存| C[OpenMP/pthread]&#10;    B --&gt;|分布式内存| D[MPI]&#10;    B --&gt;|混合| E[MPI + OpenMP]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[点对点通信&lt;br/&gt;Send/Recv]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[集合操作&lt;br/&gt;Bcast/Reduce/Scatter]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[虚拟拓扑&lt;br/&gt;Cartesian]&#10;    D --&gt; D4[并行 I/O&lt;br/&gt;MPI-IO]&#10;    E --&gt; F[域分解策略]&#10;    F --&gt; F1[块分解]&#10;    F --&gt; F2[带状分解]&#10;    F --&gt; F3[图划分]\">graph TD\n    A[并行计算模型] --&gt; B{内存模型?}\n    B --&gt;|共享内存| C[OpenMP/pthread]\n    B --&gt;|分布式内存| D[MPI]\n    B --&gt;|混合| E[MPI + OpenMP]\n    D --&gt; D1[点对点通信&lt;br/&gt;Send/Recv]\n    D --&gt; D2[集合操作&lt;br/&gt;Bcast/Reduce/Scatter]\n    D --&gt; D3[虚拟拓扑&lt;br/&gt;Cartesian]\n    D --&gt; D4[并行 I/O&lt;br/&gt;MPI-IO]\n    E --&gt; F[域分解策略]\n    F --&gt; F1[块分解]\n    F --&gt; F2[带状分解]\n    F --&gt; F3[图划分]</pre><p>MPI 是一个标准化的消息传递库规范，定义了 C、Fortran 等语言的 API。截至 2025 年，MPI 4.0 是当前生产标准，MPI 4.1 预计在 2025 年底或 2026 年初获得批准，将正式纳入 GPU 内存支持。主要实现包括 OpenMPI（5.0.x 系列为当前稳定版）、MPICH（4.2.x 系列为当前稳定版）、Intel MPI、Cray MPI 等。</p>\n<p>并行计算的基本性能指标：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>加速比（Speedup）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_p = T_1 / T_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是串行执行时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 个处理器的执行时间。理想加速比为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_p = p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>并行效率（Efficiency）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_p = S_p / p = T_1 / (p T_p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_p = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示完美线性加速。</li>\n<li><strong>强扩展（Strong Scaling）</strong>：固定总问题规模，增加处理器数。理想情况下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_p = T_1 / p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>弱扩展（Weak Scaling）</strong>：每个处理器的问题规模固定，增加处理器数（总规模随之增长）。理想情况下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_p = T_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>扩展类型</th>\n<th>问题规模</th>\n<th>处理器数</th>\n<th>理想行为</th>\n<th>实际限制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>强扩展</td>\n<td>固定</td>\n<td>增加</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_p = T_1/p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>通信开销、串行部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弱扩展</td>\n<td>每核固定</td>\n<td>增加</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_p = T_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>全局通信、内存带宽</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Amdahl 定律限制了强扩展的上限。如果程序中串行部分的比例为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>（不可并行化的部分），则最大加速比为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_p \\leq 1 / f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>。即使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f = 1\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1%</span></span></span></span></span>，最大加速比也不超过 100，无论使用多少处理器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mpi-基础\">MPI 基础</h2><p>MPI 程序的基本结构是 SPMD（Single Program, Multiple Data）：所有处理器运行同一份程序，但通过进程号（rank）来区分各自的工作。</p>\n<p>初始化和基本查询：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>MPI_Init</code>：初始化 MPI 环境。</li>\n<li><code>MPI_Comm_rank</code>：获取当前进程在通信域中的编号（rank）。</li>\n<li><code>MPI_Comm_size</code>：获取通信域中的总进程数。</li>\n<li><code>MPI_Finalize</code>：结束 MPI 环境。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>通信域（communicator）是 MPI 中进程组的抽象。<code>MPI_COMM_WORLD</code> 是默认通信域，包含所有进程。可以通过 <code>MPI_Comm_split</code> 创建子通信域，将进程分组。</p>\n<p>点对点通信是 MPI 最基本的操作：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>MPI_Send(buf, count, datatype, dest, tag, comm)</code>：向目标进程 <code>dest</code> 发送消息。</li>\n<li><code>MPI_Recv(buf, count, datatype, source, tag, comm, status)</code>：从源进程 <code>source</code> 接收消息。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>MPI_Send</code> 的语义取决于实现：可能是阻塞的（等到消息被接收或复制到系统缓冲区才返回），也可能是缓冲的。为了安全，配对的 Send/Recv 应该避免死锁——例如，所有进程同时 Send 然后同时 Recv 的模式可能导致死锁（如果 Send 是阻塞的且缓冲区不足）。</p>\n<p><code>MPI_Isend</code> 和 <code>MPI_Irecv</code> 提供非阻塞通信：调用立即返回，程序可以在通信进行的同时执行计算，然后用 <code>MPI_Wait</code> 或 <code>MPI_Test</code> 检查完成状态。计算与通信的重叠（overlap）是隐藏网络延迟的关键技术。</p>\n<h2 id=\"集合操作\">集合操作</h2><p>集合操作（collective operations）涉及通信域内的所有进程。MPI 定义了丰富的集合操作，它们通常比用户自己用点对点实现的等价操作更高效，因为实现可以利用网络拓扑和硬件特性。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>MPI_Bcast</strong>：广播。根进程将数据发送给所有进程。</li>\n<li><strong>MPI_Reduce</strong>：归约。所有进程的数据按指定操作（求和、最大值、最小值等）组合，结果返回到根进程。</li>\n<li><strong>MPI_Allreduce</strong>：全归约。Reduce + Broadcast，所有进程都得到归约结果。</li>\n<li><strong>MPI_Scatter</strong>：散射。根进程将数组的不同块发送给各进程。</li>\n<li><strong>MPI_Gather</strong>：收集。所有进程将数据发送到根进程，按顺序拼接。</li>\n<li><strong>MPI_Allgather</strong>：全收集。Gather + Broadcast，所有进程都得到完整数据。</li>\n<li><strong>MPI_Alltoall</strong>：全交换。每个进程向每个其他进程发送不同数据。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>以三维有限差分的域分解为例，每个进程拥有一个子域的网格数据。计算拉普拉斯算子需要相邻子域的边界层数据（ghost cell / halo）。这通过 <code>MPI_Sendrecv</code> 或成对的 <code>MPI_Isend</code>/<code>MPI_Irecv</code> 实现：每个进程向邻居发送自己的边界层，同时从邻居接收 ghost cell。</p>\n<p><code>MPI_Allreduce</code> 是科学计算中最常用的集合操作之一。共轭梯度法（CG）每步需要全局内积计算，GMRES 需要正交化过程中的内积，这些都通过 Allreduce 实现。在大规模并行中，Allreduce 的延迟可能成为瓶颈——这也是 <a href=\"../numerical-methods-foundations/linear-system-solvers\">线性方程组求解</a> 中讨论的迭代法在大规模并行时效率下降的原因之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"域分解\">域分解</h2><p>域分解（domain decomposition）是将 PDE 求解映射到并行计算机的标准策略。基本思想是将计算域划分为子域，每个子域分配给一个处理器。</p>\n<p>对于结构化网格（如有限差分的矩形网格），最简单的划分是块分解（block decomposition）：沿一个或多个方向将网格切分为矩形块。三维 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_x \\times N_y \\times N_z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 网格在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>z</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_x \\times p_y \\times p_z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个进程上的块分解中，每个进程拥有大约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>z</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(N_x/p_x) \\times (N_y/p_y) \\times (N_z/p_z)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 个网格点。</p>\n<p>Ghost cell（也叫 halo cell）是域分解中处理子域边界的标准技术。每个进程除了拥有自己的内部网格点外，还维护一层或多层来自相邻子域的边界数据副本。在每步计算前，进程从邻居获取最新的边界数据来更新 ghost cell；计算后，进程的边界值可能已经改变，需要发送给邻居。</p>\n<p>Ghost cell 的层数取决于数值模板的宽度。二阶中心差分需要 1 层 ghost cell（因为模板只涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i \\pm 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7429em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">±</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>），四阶紧致格式可能需要 2 层。</p>\n<p>对于非结构化网格（如有限元的三角形/四面体网格），域分解更为复杂。图划分算法（如 METIS、ParMETIS）将网格的对偶图（单元为顶点，相邻单元之间有边）划分为大致等权的子图，同时最小化子图之间的边数（对应子域之间的界面自由度）。这是一个 NP-难问题，但 METIS 等启发式算法在实践中效果很好。</p>\n<p>Schwarz 方法是一类基于域分解的迭代求解器/预条件子。重叠型 Schwarz（Additive Schwarz）在每个子域上求解局部问题，子域之间有一层或多层重叠。非重叠型 Schwarz（Substructuring / Dirichlet-Neumann）将子域界面作为耦合变量，通过迭代匹配界面条件。这些方法可以作为 <a href=\"../numerical-methods-foundations/linear-system-solvers\">线性方程组求解</a> 中讨论的预条件子使用，特别适合大规模并行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"并行-i-o\">并行 I/O</h2><p>大规模仿真的输入输出是另一个瓶颈。如果每个进程独立读写文件，可能导致数千个文件和文件系统的元数据操作风暴。MPI-IO 提供了并行 I/O 接口，允许多个进程协同读写同一个文件。</p>\n<p><code>MPI_File_open</code>、<code>MPI_File_read_at</code>、<code>MPI_File_write_at</code> 等例程提供了显式偏移量的并行 I/O。更高层的视图（<code>MPI_File_set_view</code>）允许每个进程定义文件的本地视图，使得分布式数组的读写如同本地操作。</p>\n<p>HDF5 和 NetCDF 是科学计算中最常用的并行 I/O 库，它们构建在 MPI-IO 之上，提供自描述的、可移植的数据格式。HDF5 的并行模式（Parallel HDF5）支持多个进程同时读写同一个 HDF5 文件中的数据集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混合并行与现代趋势\">混合并行与现代趋势</h2><p>现代超级计算机通常是&quot;胖节点&quot;架构：每个节点有多个 CPU 插槽（每个插槽有数十个核心），节点之间通过高速网络（InfiniBand、Slingshot）连接。在这种架构上，纯 MPI 的&quot;每个核心一个 MPI 进程&quot;模式不是最优的——节点内的通信通过共享内存更高效。</p>\n<p>混合 MPI + OpenMP 模式在每个节点内使用 OpenMP 并行化（共享内存），节点间使用 MPI 通信（分布式内存）。这减少了 MPI 进程数，降低了通信开销和内存占用。</p>\n<p>GPU 加速进一步增加了层次复杂性。在 <a href=\"gpu-cuda-acceleration\">GPU 加速与 CUDA</a> 中我们将讨论 GPU 编程模型。GPU-aware MPI 实现（如 OpenMPI 5.0.x 和 MPICH 4.2.x 都支持）允许直接从 GPU 内存发送和接收消息，无需先将数据复制到 CPU 内存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"性能考量与最佳实践\">性能考量与最佳实践</h2><p>并行程序的性能受三个因素制约：计算负载均衡、通信开销和内存访问模式。</p>\n<p>负载均衡要求每个进程的工作量大致相等。对于结构化网格和均匀计算密度，简单的块分解通常足够。对于非结构化网格或计算密度不均匀的问题（如自适应网格细化），需要动态负载均衡。</p>\n<p>通信开销由延迟（latency，发送一个零字节消息的时间）和带宽（bandwidth，单位时间传输的数据量）决定。小消息受延迟限制，大消息受带宽限制。减少消息数量（消息合并）和增大消息粒度是降低通信开销的基本策略。</p>\n<p>在 <a href=\"perf-analysis-optimization\">性能分析与优化</a> 中，我们将讨论如何系统地分析和优化并行程序的性能，包括 Roofline 模型、性能分析工具（VTune、Nsight Systems、Score-P）的使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>MPI 是大规模科学计算的基石。点对点通信提供灵活的数据交换，集合操作提供高效的全局数据操作，域分解将 PDE 求解映射到并行硬件。理解强扩展和弱扩展的区别、Amdahl 定律的限制、以及 ghost cell 和图划分等技术，是编写高效并行科学计算代码的前提。现代趋势是混合 MPI + OpenMP + GPU 的多层并行，以及 GPU-aware MPI 等技术来减少数据移动开销。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"并行计算与 MPI","id":"并行计算与-mpi"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"MPI 基础","id":"mpi-基础"},{"level":2,"text":"集合操作","id":"集合操作"},{"level":2,"text":"域分解","id":"域分解"},{"level":2,"text":"并行 I/O","id":"并行-i-o"},{"level":2,"text":"混合并行与现代趋势","id":"混合并行与现代趋势"},{"level":2,"text":"性能考量与最佳实践","id":"性能考量与最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"谱方法与伪谱法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/pde-numerical-methods/spectral-pseudospectral"},"next":{"title":"GPU 加速与 CUDA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/scientific-computing-simulation/hpc-practice/gpu-cuda-acceleration"}}